# Local development. Copy to .env.local (git-ignored); never commit a value.
#
# DATABASE_URL is read only when no Cloudflare context is available (a
# script). Under `next dev` and `wrangler dev` the app reads the HYPERDRIVE
# binding from wrangler.jsonc instead (its localConnectionString — point both
# at the same database). The database needs the `vector` extension available
# and packages/db's migrations applied (README → Local development).
DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/docs
# Optional. Unset, the embeddings and the answers are Workers AI's, through
# the AI binding (`next dev` reaches it after `wrangler login`). Set, the
# ANSWERS are OpenAI's; `next dev` reads it from here, `wrangler dev` from
# .dev.vars.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# Optional. The bearer POST /api/embeddings?refresh=1 needs; unset, refresh
# answers 403 (the plain POST needs nothing).
# REINDEX_TOKEN=
